<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA- UHIS SIGNS 12 MLN MARK LOAN AGREEMENT.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA- UHIS SIGNS 12 MLN MARK LOAN AGREEMENT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uhispank said on Friday it had signed a loan agreement of 12 million marks for ten years with the European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD).</p>
<p>The loan will be used for housing loans, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
